                        "id": "f8c422e",
                        "elType": "widget",
                        "settings": {
                            "editor": "<p>As explained in the e-mail sent by <a href=\"/\">SABER College,</a> new regulations from the <a href=\"https://studentaid.gov/help-center/answers/article/federal-direct-loan-program\">Department of Education (the Direct Loans)</a> require that each school determine the Cost of Living for the students based the school’s population.</p>",
